# TraceDetector — optional Gemini AI Analysis backend
#
# The app works fully WITHOUT any of these values:
#   • On-Device Scan  — real metadata / barcode / filename analysis in the browser
#   • Demo Analysis   — clearly-labelled sample report
#
# Set a key here to additionally unlock "AI Analysis", powered by Google's
# Gemini API via the official @google/genai SDK.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill it in:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# IMPORTANT:
#   - Never commit a real API key to GitHub.
#   - These variables are deliberately NOT prefixed with VITE_, which means
#     Vite will never inline them into the client bundle. They are read only
#     by the server-side handlers in /api, and the key is never returned by
#     any endpoint or logged.

# Required to enable AI Analysis. Get a key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# A Gemini multimodal/vision-capable Flash model id. Optional — defaults to a
# broadly-available model if left blank. If the model below is not available
# for your API key/account, change this value; nothing else needs to change.
GEMINI_MODEL=
